@startuml
title 08. Metrics Computation Pipeline

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam componentArrowThickness 2

package "Domain Layer" {
  [MetricsEngine] as ME
  [Subscription Entity] as Sub
  [Transaction Entity] as Tx
  [DailyMetricsSnapshot] as Snap
}

package "Application Layer" {
  [MetricsAggregationService] as Agg
}

package "Interfaces Layer" {
  [MetricsHandler] as MH
}

package "Infrastructure Layer" {
  [SnapshotRepository] as SR
  database "PostgreSQL\ndaily_metrics_snapshots" as DB
}

Sub --> ME : subscriptions[]
Tx --> ME : transactions[]

ME --> Snap : ComputeAllMetrics()

note right of ME
  **KPI Formulas:**
  Active MRR = Σ(SAFE sub.MRRCents)
  Revenue at Risk = Σ(at-risk sub.MRRCents)
  Usage Revenue = Σ(USAGE tx.AmountCents)
  Total Revenue = REC + USE + ONE - REF
  Renewal Rate = SAFE / total subs
end note

Snap --> SR : Upsert() / UpsertBatch()
SR --> DB : INSERT ON CONFLICT UPDATE\n(batches of 50 for backfill)

MH --> Agg : BuildMetrics(appID, range)
Agg --> SR : FindByAppIDAndRange()
SR --> Agg : snapshots[]
Agg --> Agg : DownsampleSnapshots(\n  granularity)
Agg --> MH : aggregated response

note bottom of Agg
  **Trend API (ADR-041):**
  GetTrendSnapshots() fetches daily
  snapshots and downsamples to
  DAILY / WEEKLY / MONTHLY
  by picking last snapshot per period.
  No separate tables needed.
end note

@enduml
